OL,3,GNEWSAPlanned increase in hospital
OL,4,Aparking charges paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to increase parking charges at
OL,7,Ftwo West Sussex hospitals have been
OL,8,Fpaused after the NHS trust said it had
OL,9,Flistened to "concerns people have
OL,10,Fraised".
OL,12,FThe proposals at Worthing Hospital and
OL,13,FSt Richard's Hospital in Chichester
OL,14,Fwere met with dismay by the public, as
OL,15,Fwell as Chichester MP Jess
OL,16,FBrown-Fuller.
OL,18,FThe changes, which were planned to come
OL,19,Fin on Monday, would have seen one hour
OL,20,Fof parking at Worthing Hospital double
OL,21,Fto #3, and rise from #1.80 to #3.70 at
OL,22,FSt Richard's Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
