OL,3,GNEWSAPlanned increase in hospital
OL,4,Aparking charges paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for University Hospitals
OL,7,FSussex NHS Foundation Trust said that,
OL,8,Ffollowing the concerns, it was pausing
OL,9,Fthe proposed changes "while we review
OL,10,Fthem".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
